  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero engaki eyio eraike, ensoko netuboke ase abanto b’enyomba ya Daudi, na ase abanto ba Yerusalemu, erinde basibigwe korwa ase ebibe biabo, na ogotacheneka kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio ninsirie amarieta ’emegwekano egosasimwa ase ense eye, tagwatorwa naende nonya ng’ake. Boigo nindusie ababani amo n’Omoika bw’ogotacheneka korwa aiga.” Nabo Omonene bw’Emeganda agoteeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo erabe ng’a omonto aise kooroka kobana, ng’ina na ise abwo bamoiborete bamoteebie, “Aye tokonyara koba moyo, ekiagera nigo okobana oborimo ase erieta ri’Omonene.” Ekero omonto oyio agendererete kobana, abaibori abwo baye mbamobete ritimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio kera omobani nabe nobosooku ase amaroro aye ekero akobana; gose onde takobeeka eganchwa eroiseirie amarionya ase okong’aina abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera oyomo obo nigo arakane atebe: Inche tindi omobani, korende nigo inde omoremi, ekiagera korwa obwana bwane nigo nagoretwe ngakorwa omosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto karamoborie, “Ng’ai kwanyorete ebimanyererio ebi bie chingoma bire ase amaboko ao?” Ere nairanerie, “Ebi nigo nabinyorete korwa ase enyomba y’abwo inyanchete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogochika kw’ogoita omorisia o Nyasae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: “Aye omoro, imoka orwanie omorisia one, oyio ore oyomo nainche. Aka omorisia oyio, erinde ching’ondi chiserebekane; erio inche ing’onchore okoboko kwane igoro ya chiria chire chindeu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: “Nigo erabe ng’a chinsemo ibere ase isato chi’abwo bamenyete ase ense eria mbaitwe basirigwe, korende ensemo eyemo y’abwo netigare ere moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto b’ensemo eyio eyemo ya isato nimbaetie ase omorero ime, mbasibie buna efeta egosibigwa, na mbateeme buna etaabu egoteemwa. Barabwo mbarangerie erieta riane ng’a batoorigwe, na inche nimbaigwe. Inche nintebe: Abanto abwo nabaane. Barabwo mbairanerie: Omonene nere Nyasae oito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
